WEBVTT

00:05:27.328 --> 00:05:30.363
and to sustain their action
over the long term.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.006
The European Union is open to cooperate

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.203
with anyone who's ready
to engage in this journey.

00:05:36.997 --> 00:05:41.990
Fixing climate change
calls for everyone's action every day.

00:05:42.718 --> 00:05:44.248
You can count on me.

00:05:44.605 --> 00:05:46.425
I count on you.

00:05:46.821 --> 00:05:48.000
Thank you.